{"name":"American Samoa","slug":"american-samoa","code":"AS","continent":"Oceania","hero":"plonkit/american-samoa/Pola_Islands_Tutuila_NPS.webp","updated":"2023-10-12T00:00:00.000Z","sections":[{"title":"Identifying American Samoa","title_zh":"辨識美屬薩摩亞","items":[{"id":"Ve3W","text":["**American Samoa** is a group of islands east of Fiji, located in the Pacific Ocean. Since it is a US overseas territory, for country streak purposes, it is counted as the US."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/american-samoa/as_locator.webp","link":"","clues":[],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"OwzU","text":["The general landscape consists of **green, tropical** mountains with many palm trees. Small roads are often made of [concrete](https://goo.gl/maps/GENv4jmjUzvkSbp38). Most houses are one storey, and have a simple box design. Plain **metal sheet** roofs are also very common."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/american-samoa/image.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/9J2TRoEJL2CfdnZF9","clues":["architecture","nature","scenery"],"important":false,"tagged":false}]},{"title":"Island specific clues","title_zh":"島嶼專屬線索","items":[{"id":"pQyl","text":["A slightly **rusted black** truck bed can be seen on the main island of Tutuila.","This is the most common car that will be seen as it has the most coverage."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/american-samoa/main_island_car.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/JsSbHdpLifbJ1Jdt8","clues":[],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"0C0S","text":["The front of a **silver-grey** truck with side mirrors can be seen on Manu’a and Olosega, which are connected by a bridge.","_See below for more information._"],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/american-samoa/other_island_car.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/Ec2D9s8PzZsWwfkXA","clues":[],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"UnVR","text":["The front of a similar truck can be seen on the easternmost covered island of Tau. However, the truck will be **glossy black**, with side mirrors visible."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/american-samoa/other_other_island_car.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/89AgZvTc9HJjYqCk8","clues":[],"important":false,"tagged":false}]},{"title":"Spotlight","title_zh":"重點地標","items":[{"id":"W6tU","text":["The **single-lane** bridge, connecting the islands of Manu’a and Olosega, can be easily recognized by the thin wire guardrail, with the two islands on either side of the bridge."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/american-samoa/bride.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/KyriaPF11ZHRuwM47","clues":["guardrails"],"important":false,"tagged":true},{"id":"H73S","text":["Ofu Airport is small with a **concrete** runway. The Google Car covering it has two **orange straps** on the roof. Many palm trees can also be seen on the other side of the runway."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/american-samoa/boeing_real_estate.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/mK54EUK79dgWx7qv6","clues":["google_vehicles","architecture","nature"],"important":false,"tagged":false}]}],"tip_count":7,"facts":{"driving_side":"right","phone_numbers":"+1 (684)","domains":[".as"],"currencies":[{"name":"United States dollar","symbol":"$ or US$ or U$","status":"official","code":"USD"}],"years":["2015","2016","2017","2019","2021","2022","2023","2024","2025"],"lines":[["white"],["yellow"],["white"]]},"gallery":{"architecture":[{"image":"geohints/architecture/american_samoa_1.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/hz6ibto1d8sLojnE7"},{"image":"geohints/architecture/american_samoa_2.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/EJfFsjrd6RUMfcTm8"}],"companies":[{"image":"geohints/companies/companies_265.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/FiuTicjbHwXHZABc6"}],"gas_stations":[{"image":"geohints/companies/companies_1346.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/c7qBCQCE7A8VRcdc7"}],"flags":[{"image":"geohints/flags/flags_4.svg","link":""}],"google_vehicles":[{"image":"geohints/googleVehicles/boat_153.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/pSkh2QL2vYQfrqdRA"},{"image":"geohints/googleVehicles/boat_302.webp","link":"https://goo.